            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GoldenHen5196"
            },
            "reviewBody": "For those who are not huge fans of bubbly champagne, try crème de cassis with white wine. So good!!! Simply called a “kir,” it is a very common aperitif in France.",
            "datePublished": "2022-08-08T03:08:55.871Z"
          },
